{"4093200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buggos: Death Squad", "steam_appid": 4093200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER CO-OP HORDE SURVIVAL SHOOTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your loadout on the drop ship, land on a planet the Buggos are eating alive, and build your defenses to hold off the swarm. Live long enough to collect sufficient research materials and escape. The swarm attacks hundreds at a time and evolves every wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SWARM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on top of the nests spawning, and watch out for the swarms attack waves. But be warned... the Hivemind evolves over time and will upgrade the swarm to counter your build. New species, growing evolutions, and boss Buggos will assault your base as you try to hold out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PREPARE FOR DROP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your loadout on the ship and drop into battle on the planet itself. Unlock new weapons, armor, and modules as you defeat challenges and conquer higher difficulties. Meta progression (with free respec) allows you to specialize into your preferred play style. Want to be a base builder? Unlock more turrets and building health! Want to go out and kill the bugs and find artifacts? Setup your marine with combat armor and health regen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCKETS AND MODULES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All buildings, weapons, and armor have module sockets. Modules allow you to modify your items with new effects. For example: Give your weapons split shot, chain, or create explosions on kill. Provide walls with regen modules or riposte modules so they can shoot back at whatever hits them. You can even mix and match them! Create a wall that teleports on hit, and shoots back at any Buggos who attacked it, then it explodes on death.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER CO-OP HORDE SURVIVAL SHOOTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your loadout on the drop ship, land on a planet the Buggos are eating alive, and build your defenses to hold off the swarm. Live long enough to collect sufficient research materials and escape. The swarm attacks hundreds at a time and evolves every wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/bdf928d55bc9278e97637e6933ce1843.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SWARM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on top of the nests spawning, and watch out for the swarms attack waves. But be warned... the Hivemind evolves over time and will upgrade the swarm to counter your build. New species, growing evolutions, and boss Buggos will assault your base as you try to hold out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/08372891dd71a703eff88c7e2c4abc4a.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PREPARE FOR DROP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your loadout on the ship and drop into battle on the planet itself. Unlock new weapons, armor, and modules as you defeat challenges and conquer higher difficulties. Meta progression (with free respec) allows you to specialize into your preferred play style. Want to be a base builder? Unlock more turrets and building health! Want to go out and kill the bugs and find artifacts? Setup your marine with combat armor and health regen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/d0ee0b1dc3fcb9694eb5c0de59d24bf2.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCKETS AND MODULES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All buildings, weapons, and armor have module sockets. Modules allow you to modify your items with new effects. For example: Give your weapons split shot, chain, or create explosions on kill. Provide walls with regen modules or riposte modules so they can shoot back at whatever hits them. You can even mix and match them! Create a wall that teleports on hit, and shoots back at any Buggos who attacked it, then it explodes on death.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.poster.avif?t=1787341841\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.webm?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/extras/0f2ba6f840508c6742fa546f77035e04.mp4?t=1787341841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "4-player co-op horde survival shooter with base building. Customize your loadout on the drop ship, land on a world the Buggos are eating alive, and raise a fortress of turrets. Hold it as the swarm attacks hundreds at a time and evolves every wave. They devour worlds. We defend them.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093200/737ef294ed1db9669e3d35b80969e59320aa0224/header.jpg?t=1787341841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4